WEBVTT

01:36.960 --> 01:38.920
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:39.000 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:58.520 --> 02:00.560
Why do I feel so bad?

02:02.320 --> 02:04.800
I knew we would be apart.

02:06.160 --> 02:08.600
I shouldn't have let him stay
in the first place.

02:08.680 --> 02:11.320
I shouldn't have let him stay
in Arbiter Hall for so long.

02:13.800 --> 02:15.000
Forget it.

02:15.080 --> 02:16.160
It's better to leave.

02:16.840 --> 02:18.480
He'll be safe.

02:24.280 --> 02:25.840
I'm so sleepy.

02:49.840 --> 02:50.760
My lord.

02:51.320 --> 02:53.120
She has recovered.

02:53.720 --> 02:56.200
So the reason she can't totally recover

02:57.400 --> 02:59.880
is because she's worried about my safety?

03:00.520 --> 03:01.800
Shangque.

03:01.880 --> 03:02.760
Tell me.

03:04.200 --> 03:05.280
If she had known

03:05.360 --> 03:07.840
I was Dongfang Qingcang
from the beginning,

03:07.920 --> 03:10.480
would she have changed her mind
about the Moon Tribe

03:10.560 --> 03:12.080
and risked her life to save me?

03:14.320 --> 03:15.160
Well…

03:20.800 --> 03:21.680
Forget it.

03:22.480 --> 03:24.120
I don't even know that myself.

03:24.680 --> 03:25.640
Why should I ask you?

03:25.720 --> 03:26.640
My lord.

03:27.840 --> 03:29.920
Why don't we let her
fix the Destiny Book now?

03:30.480 --> 03:31.560
Let her sleep first.

03:33.480 --> 03:34.600
Let's talk about it tomorrow.

03:36.840 --> 03:37.680
Yes.

04:26.600 --> 04:27.840
Little Flower Spirit.

04:27.920 --> 04:30.560
This Bone Orchid is transformed
from my blood.

04:30.640 --> 04:31.920
To repay you,

04:32.000 --> 04:33.200
I'll give it to you now.

04:39.600 --> 04:40.760
When you're in danger,

04:41.480 --> 04:42.640
it can protect you.

04:44.240 --> 04:45.400
From now on,

04:46.000 --> 04:47.600
no one can hurt you

04:48.880 --> 04:50.320
even if I'm not by your side.

05:18.680 --> 05:20.280
My lord, Changheng is here.

05:21.720 --> 05:22.640
Changheng?

05:24.840 --> 05:26.160
Why did he come to Haishi?

05:26.720 --> 05:27.680
I don't know.

05:28.200 --> 05:31.320
However, the news of the evil spirit
in Haishi

05:31.400 --> 05:32.680
has spread across the three realms.

05:33.720 --> 05:35.440
I'm afraid he's here

05:35.520 --> 05:36.640
because he got the news.

05:37.640 --> 05:39.400
My lord, what should we do?

05:40.400 --> 05:41.480
Since he's here,

05:42.120 --> 05:43.320
we should meet him.

05:44.840 --> 05:45.760
Yes.

05:54.040 --> 05:56.800
The God of War in Shuiyuntian
came to Haishi

05:57.760 --> 05:59.000
to buy something

05:59.720 --> 06:01.080
or sell something?

06:01.640 --> 06:02.840
I came here

06:02.920 --> 06:04.440
to ask you something.

06:04.520 --> 06:05.600
Lord of Haishi.

06:07.040 --> 06:08.200
Do you recognize this?

06:12.320 --> 06:13.480
Evil spirit?

06:14.560 --> 06:15.520
Yes.

06:15.600 --> 06:17.920
Not long ago,
it hurt a fairy in Shuiyuntian.

06:18.720 --> 06:19.960
As far as I know,

06:20.040 --> 06:22.320
the evil spirit is related to Haishi.

06:22.400 --> 06:23.960
People here only talk about business

06:24.040 --> 06:25.160
and never make enemies.

06:25.240 --> 06:27.240
It seems that

06:27.320 --> 06:29.000
you're suspecting Haishi.

06:29.560 --> 06:32.240
The evil spirit first appeared in Haishi.

06:32.320 --> 06:34.560
Then Liufang Pavilion was in chaos
and suffered casualties.

06:34.640 --> 06:35.640
Why is that?

06:39.640 --> 06:40.920
Do you know

06:41.600 --> 06:43.040
that information in Haishi

06:44.160 --> 06:45.120
costs money?

06:47.520 --> 06:48.440
However,

06:48.520 --> 06:50.720
I can make an exception
for Lord Changheng.

06:51.320 --> 06:52.200
Why?

06:52.280 --> 06:54.840
The appearance of the evil spirit
caused chaos in Haishi

06:54.920 --> 06:58.240
is all because of a mysterious man
who trespassed in Haishi.

06:59.160 --> 07:00.360
A mysterious man?

07:00.920 --> 07:03.480
That mysterious man
has unfathomable power.

07:04.040 --> 07:06.000
He not only brought the evil spirit
to Haishi,

07:06.640 --> 07:08.520
but also destroyed
the foundation of Haishi.

07:09.080 --> 07:11.680
Recently, Haishi has been chaotic.

07:12.440 --> 07:13.320
You mean

07:13.960 --> 07:16.480
this evil spirit was produced
by that mysterious man?

07:17.080 --> 07:17.920
Dieyi.

07:33.320 --> 07:34.160
Hellfire?

07:35.240 --> 07:36.160
That's right.

07:37.320 --> 07:38.960
Among the three realms,

07:39.640 --> 07:42.840
except Dongfang Qingcang
who was sealed 30,000 years ago,

07:42.920 --> 07:44.400
no one can manipulate Hellfire.

07:47.400 --> 07:48.480
Sorry for my offense today.

07:49.160 --> 07:50.280
I'll apologize another day.

07:51.040 --> 07:52.080
Goodbye.

07:52.160 --> 07:53.120
By the way,

07:54.280 --> 07:56.880
when the mysterious man left Haishi,

07:57.720 --> 07:59.600
he took a Shuiyuntian fairy with him.

08:00.720 --> 08:01.560
Who?

08:02.520 --> 08:04.080
It is said to be

08:04.160 --> 08:06.240
a nameless orchid plant spirit.

08:11.920 --> 08:12.880
Thank you.

08:21.480 --> 08:22.480
My lord,

08:22.560 --> 08:25.280
why did you tell Changheng

08:25.360 --> 08:26.360
about Dongfang Qingqing?

08:27.120 --> 08:28.800
Dongfang Qingqing has incredible power.

08:29.800 --> 08:31.640
If he stays by the fairy's side,

08:32.400 --> 08:33.720
we can't do anything.

08:33.799 --> 08:35.919
But if we join hands with Changheng,

08:36.720 --> 08:38.200
we might be able to defeat him.

08:49.040 --> 08:50.920
I drank too much last night.

08:54.040 --> 08:54.960
Gosh.

08:56.400 --> 08:58.240
I'm going to be late for the ceremony.

09:09.520 --> 09:10.400
My lord,

09:11.120 --> 09:13.360
shouldn't we stop her
and let her fix the Destiny Book?

09:13.440 --> 09:15.160
Today is the ceremony of assigning posts.

09:15.800 --> 09:17.800
It's also the day she becomes a fairy.

09:18.360 --> 09:19.200
But…

09:19.280 --> 09:21.360
What does this have to do
with fixing the Destiny Book?

09:21.440 --> 09:24.480
She has been waiting 1,000 years
for this day.

09:25.560 --> 09:27.400
I don’t want to disappoint her.

09:30.440 --> 09:31.760
ARBITER HALL

09:49.400 --> 09:51.240
My lord, someone is here.

09:51.320 --> 09:52.320
It’s Changheng.

09:55.320 --> 09:57.320
I didn't plan to kill him,

09:58.240 --> 09:59.920
but he's courting death.

10:39.800 --> 10:40.720
Dongfang Qingcang.

10:43.560 --> 10:44.680
It's really you.

10:49.760 --> 10:50.640
Let’s begin.

10:55.240 --> 10:56.880
There are many fairies in Shuiyuntian.

10:56.960 --> 10:58.600
After the war between the two tribes,

10:58.680 --> 11:01.640
according to the fairies' real bodies,

11:01.720 --> 11:04.520
Lord Dong divided them
into the eight-immortal system,

11:04.600 --> 11:08.040
which are Heaven, Earth, Thunder, Water,
Fire, Wind, Lake, and Mountain.

11:08.120 --> 11:09.680
You have passed the examination.

11:09.760 --> 11:12.080
Today, the Great Turtle will check

11:12.160 --> 11:13.800
your real bodies

11:13.880 --> 11:15.000
and assign posts to you.

11:16.280 --> 11:17.760
- Yes.
- Yes.

11:30.040 --> 11:31.160
Fairy Yuanwu.

11:57.920 --> 12:00.120
Thunder, Fengbo Hall.

12:07.680 --> 12:09.120
Fairy Orchid.

13:02.960 --> 13:09.160
THE GREAT TURTLE

13:16.520 --> 13:18.360
It turns out to be an old friend.

13:19.320 --> 13:20.280
An old friend?

13:21.320 --> 13:23.160
My ancient god, Xuanwu,

13:24.040 --> 13:25.640
do you know me?

13:27.480 --> 13:28.720
Yes.

13:31.240 --> 13:32.600
I read that

13:33.080 --> 13:36.240
you know all living creatures
in this world.

13:37.000 --> 13:39.120
You are special.

13:41.320 --> 13:43.880
Me? Why?

13:44.760 --> 13:48.440
Joy and sorrow, parting and reunion.

13:49.120 --> 13:51.160
All living beings in the world

13:51.240 --> 13:53.440
have thousands of fates.

13:54.320 --> 13:57.520
But you only have one fate.

14:00.120 --> 14:03.000
God, I don't understand what you mean.

14:04.880 --> 14:06.480
When you understand,

14:07.200 --> 14:10.920
you'll begin to bear your destiny.

14:11.720 --> 14:13.000
What destiny?

14:13.880 --> 14:14.960
My old friend,

14:15.720 --> 14:16.960
take care.

14:24.120 --> 14:25.600
It has been so long.

14:25.680 --> 14:26.720
What's going on?

14:26.800 --> 14:28.000
What's taking so long?

14:29.360 --> 14:30.600
Did something happen?

14:30.680 --> 14:31.880
Is everything okay?

14:31.960 --> 14:33.240
The result is overdue.

14:41.720 --> 14:42.960
Why is there nothing?

14:43.040 --> 14:44.320
Isn't she a plant spirit?

14:44.400 --> 14:45.360
- Yes.
- I don't know.

14:45.440 --> 14:46.920
So she should be in Lake or Mountain.

14:47.000 --> 14:48.200
Why can't she be identified?

14:48.280 --> 14:50.280
This has never happened before.

14:55.080 --> 14:57.520
Aunt Sansheng, is there any problem?

14:58.920 --> 14:59.840
Fairy Yuanwu.

14:59.920 --> 15:01.160
One more time, please.

15:23.680 --> 15:24.720
There it is.

15:24.800 --> 15:26.040
What's wrong with Orchid?

15:26.120 --> 15:27.000
Yes, what's wrong?

15:27.080 --> 15:28.240
Fairy Orchid.

15:28.320 --> 15:29.600
Try it again.

15:47.400 --> 15:48.760
What's going on?

15:48.840 --> 15:50.720
- What happened?
- What is that?

15:50.800 --> 15:52.040
Is she not a fairy?

15:52.120 --> 15:54.640
- What happened?
- So strange.

15:55.800 --> 15:57.120
Sansheng,

15:57.200 --> 15:58.800
check her real body.

15:58.880 --> 16:00.080
Yes.

16:10.840 --> 16:12.440
What is this?

16:12.520 --> 16:15.040
- I've never seen it before.
- What is this?

16:15.120 --> 16:16.520
What is this?

16:16.600 --> 16:18.160
Strange. I've never seen it before.

16:18.240 --> 16:19.400
So what is it?

16:22.600 --> 16:25.120
I'm an orchid plant.

16:25.200 --> 16:26.360
How is that possible?

16:26.440 --> 16:28.840
Your real body is not an orchid plant.

16:28.920 --> 16:31.680
And you're not in
the eight-immortal system of Shuiyuntian.

16:32.760 --> 16:34.040
Orchid isn't a fairy?

16:34.120 --> 16:36.240
She's not a flower spirit?

16:36.320 --> 16:38.120
If you're neither an immortal nor a human,

16:38.640 --> 16:40.200
you're from the Moon Tribe.

16:40.840 --> 16:42.920
- The Moon Tribe?
- The Moon Tribe?

16:43.000 --> 16:44.520
- How can that be?
- What's wrong?

16:44.600 --> 16:47.320
- The Moon Tribe?
- How could I be from the Moon Tribe?

16:47.880 --> 16:49.960
Master told me I was an orchid seed

16:50.040 --> 16:51.680
she brought from Yunmeng Lake.

16:51.760 --> 16:53.800
She planted me in the Arbiter Hall.

16:53.880 --> 16:56.880
Aunt Sansheng, you saw me transform.

16:56.960 --> 16:58.200
I'm not from the Moon Tribe.

16:58.280 --> 17:01.880
That orchid seed must be your disguise.

17:04.960 --> 17:05.839
Guards!

17:12.160 --> 17:13.319
I'm not from the Moon Tribe.

17:13.400 --> 17:14.560
I'm an orchid plant.

17:14.640 --> 17:15.760
There must be a mistake.

17:23.319 --> 17:24.599
This is…

17:24.680 --> 17:25.800
What's that?

17:29.200 --> 17:30.400
That's…

17:38.640 --> 17:39.840
Hellfire.

17:54.840 --> 17:57.040
Dongfang Qingcang, where are you escaping?

17:57.880 --> 17:58.720
Escape?

17:59.960 --> 18:02.800
I just don't want to destroy
her Arbiter Hall.

19:04.600 --> 19:05.840
Hellfire?

19:06.920 --> 19:09.560
It's indeed Dongfang Qingcang's Hellfire.

19:16.600 --> 19:18.120
I don't know what happened.

19:45.320 --> 19:49.400
Tell me, where is Dongfang Qingcang?

20:53.200 --> 20:56.840
Where is Dongfang Qingcang?

20:59.080 --> 21:00.320
I don't know.

21:37.000 --> 21:37.920
Do you want to die?

21:40.360 --> 21:41.960
I know what you want to ask.

21:42.040 --> 21:44.240
But what's most important
is to catch Dongfang Qingcang.

21:44.320 --> 21:45.680
Go tell Lord Yunzhong.

22:02.720 --> 22:06.000
Where is Dongfang Qingcang?

22:06.560 --> 22:08.120
Orchid, tell us.

22:08.200 --> 22:09.600
If you don't tell us, you'll die.

22:09.680 --> 22:11.240
Her real body is unknown.

22:11.320 --> 22:13.040
I think she's a spy from the Moon Tribe.

22:14.280 --> 22:15.920
I'm not from the Moon Tribe.

22:16.640 --> 22:18.280
I'm not a spy.

22:19.720 --> 22:20.720
I don't know anything.

22:22.000 --> 22:26.280
Why would Dongfang Qingcang's Hellfire
protect you?

22:29.040 --> 22:30.400
I really don’t know.

22:55.320 --> 22:56.400
How dare you

22:57.480 --> 22:58.640
hurt my woman?

23:20.160 --> 23:22.120
Dongfang Qingcang.

24:11.200 --> 24:12.960
You are Dongfang Qingcang?

24:32.080 --> 24:33.480
You lied to me.

24:33.560 --> 24:35.080
I never lied to you.

24:37.240 --> 24:38.920
Why did you save me?

24:39.560 --> 24:40.400
I told you

24:41.600 --> 24:43.120
your life is mine.

24:43.720 --> 24:44.920
With me,

24:45.000 --> 24:46.200
no one can hurt you.

26:48.960 --> 26:50.120
No!

27:52.880 --> 27:54.680
If anyone dares to stop me,

27:55.160 --> 27:57.000
I will destroy Shuiyuntian

27:57.080 --> 27:58.760
and kill everyone.

28:03.440 --> 28:05.680
I'll avenge

28:06.280 --> 28:08.160
the shame of the seal

28:09.200 --> 28:10.480
for 30,000 years

28:11.800 --> 28:13.520
and the oppression of Cangyan Sea.

28:42.360 --> 28:43.400
Put her down.

28:44.480 --> 28:45.840
How dare you

28:45.920 --> 28:47.480
stop me?

29:51.680 --> 29:52.600
Get out of my way.

29:55.920 --> 29:58.040
I won't let you take her away.

29:58.520 --> 30:00.680
I don't want to kill you today.

31:18.040 --> 31:19.000
Step aside.

31:19.680 --> 31:21.600
I said step aside!

31:31.280 --> 31:32.240
Step aside!

31:32.320 --> 31:34.440
Put her down!

32:03.400 --> 32:04.640
Stop!

32:34.160 --> 32:35.720
Do you want to save her

32:36.320 --> 32:38.640
or your Shuiyuntian?

32:53.200 --> 32:54.320
Lord Changheng!

32:55.240 --> 32:56.240
My lord!

32:59.440 --> 33:00.720
Lord Changheng!

33:00.800 --> 33:02.760
The Four-River Pearl controls Shuiyuntian.

33:02.840 --> 33:04.440
Rivers Xiao, Xiang, Li, and Yuan
are the source.

33:04.520 --> 33:06.680
If we don't make up for it,
the water will flow backward.

33:06.760 --> 33:08.560
The whole Shuiyuntian and Yunmeng Lake

33:08.640 --> 33:10.040
will be in misery.

33:31.480 --> 33:35.920
OBLIVION RIVER

33:42.680 --> 33:44.240
Why is she still unconscious?

33:48.080 --> 33:48.920
My lord,

33:49.840 --> 33:52.080
she was poisoned by Lord Yunzhong's
Xuanshuang Whip.

33:53.040 --> 33:54.320
And the cold Oblivion River

33:54.960 --> 33:56.080
prevents her from recovering.

33:57.440 --> 33:59.360
How can I cure her?

33:59.440 --> 34:00.840
My lord, please calm down.

34:00.920 --> 34:02.400
The most important thing now

34:02.480 --> 34:03.480
is to warm her up.

34:04.320 --> 34:06.320
But the Oblivion River is extremely cold.

34:07.240 --> 34:08.880
Only your Hellfire can…

34:14.199 --> 34:15.480
Go ahead and explore the way.

34:15.560 --> 34:16.520
Yes.

34:40.239 --> 34:41.080
You…

34:41.719 --> 34:42.800
Are you afraid of me?

34:49.400 --> 34:50.639
Where are we?

34:57.080 --> 34:59.280
This is the Oblivion River,
the boundary of two tribes.

34:59.360 --> 35:00.840
Do you want to take me to Cangyan Sea?

35:22.920 --> 35:24.520
Moon Supreme, I'm sorry.

35:25.080 --> 35:26.720
I was wrong.

35:26.800 --> 35:28.920
I shouldn't have listened to rumors
and made fun of you.

35:29.000 --> 35:31.640
I even asked you to do chores.

35:31.720 --> 35:32.880
I also said

35:32.960 --> 35:35.960
you paid no attention to hygiene.

35:36.040 --> 35:36.960
I'm sorry.

35:37.040 --> 35:39.720
I even said you're a homeless dog.

35:57.320 --> 35:58.480
Moon Supreme.

35:59.400 --> 36:02.120
If there's nothing else to do,

36:02.200 --> 36:03.760
I'll take my leave.

36:04.320 --> 36:05.960
You don't have to see me off.

36:06.040 --> 36:08.200
I can go back to Shuiyuntian myself.

36:08.280 --> 36:09.640
Back to Shuiyuntian?

36:09.720 --> 36:11.160
You are a traitor now.

36:11.800 --> 36:13.720
Do you want them to kill you?

36:14.960 --> 36:16.160
I'm not a traitor.

36:17.720 --> 36:19.120
I'm not a traitor.

36:19.200 --> 36:21.200
I will explain to them.

36:41.000 --> 36:42.720
I'm not a traitor.

36:43.880 --> 36:45.840
Shuiyuntian is my home.

36:46.480 --> 36:49.680
I want to go home.

36:54.640 --> 36:56.560
I want to go home.

37:01.240 --> 37:03.560
Shuiyuntian is my home.

37:03.640 --> 37:05.800
I want to go home.

37:07.560 --> 37:08.600
That's over.

37:08.680 --> 37:11.720
I'm not a traitor.

37:16.880 --> 37:17.720
My lord.

37:18.320 --> 37:21.760
Lord Xunfeng is fighting
with the two kings of You in Wind Plain.

37:21.840 --> 37:24.840
They've conquered Silver Lake
and are heading to Ninth You.

37:24.920 --> 37:26.560
How long can Xunfeng last?

37:27.040 --> 37:28.040
I'm afraid

37:29.040 --> 37:30.280
he won't survive tonight.

37:31.920 --> 37:33.680
The kings have always been ambitious
and covet

37:33.760 --> 37:35.080
the position of the Moon Supreme.

37:35.160 --> 37:37.000
They didn't dare to do anything

37:37.080 --> 37:38.640
because they were afraid of your power.

37:39.640 --> 37:41.400
But since you were told dead,

37:41.960 --> 37:44.160
Lord Xunfeng became the new Moon Supreme.

37:44.240 --> 37:46.360
The Kings of North and South You

37:46.440 --> 37:48.240
kept starting civil wars to replace him.

37:48.800 --> 37:49.920
If we go back late,

37:50.000 --> 37:51.400
Lord Xunfeng may be…

38:27.720 --> 38:29.400
- Go to Wind Plain.
- Yes.

39:07.080 --> 39:08.920
Keep your eyes open

39:09.840 --> 39:12.080
and have a look.

39:12.160 --> 39:15.560
I'm not that kind of guy
who can be beaten up

39:16.040 --> 39:19.280
or killed by you immortals.
